# Medident — ERP Software

An ongoing full-stack **Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP)** web application designed to streamline end-to-end business operations—covering inventory, procurement, sales, customer management, financial accounting, and business reporting. Built with **React**, **Vite**, **Tailwind CSS**, and **React Query**.

---

## ⚠️ Important Notice (Please Read Before Testing)

> **This is an active, ongoing project with live and valid business records.**  
> The codebase is open for review and testing. Please check everything thoroughly, **but do not delete or modify any existing data.** All records in the database exist for valid operational reasons.

